# Network - Topology Diagram Template

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "DMZ"
        LB[Load Balancer]
        WAF[WAF]
    end
    
    subgraph "Public Subnet"
        NAT[NAT Gateway]
        Bastion[Bastion Host]
    end
    
    subgraph "Private Subnet - App Tier"
        App1[App Server 1]
        App2[App Server 2]
        App3[App Server 3]
    end
    
    subgraph "Private Subnet - Data Tier"
        DBPrimary[(Primary DB)]
        DBReplica[(Read Replica)]
        Cache[(Redis Cache)]
    end
    
    Internet((Internet)) --> LB
    LB --> WAF
    WAF --> App1
    WAF --> App2
    WAF --> App3
    
    App1 --> DBPrimary
    App2 --> DBPrimary
    App3 --> DBPrimary
    
    App1 --> Cache
    App2 --> Cache
    App3 --> Cache
    
    DBPrimary --> DBReplica
    
    Admin[Admin] --> Bastion
    Bastion --> App1
    Bastion --> App2
    
    style LB fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0
    style WAF fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828
    style DBPrimary fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
```

## Usage
Define your network topology with subnets, security zones, and connectivity.